# Lightferry key: 64 hex chars (32 bytes) or @path to a key file. Never commit a real key.
# Generate one with `lightferry keygen --out lightferry.key` (mode 600, git-ignored), move it to the other
# machine by hand, then point at it:
LIGHTFERRY_KEY=@lightferry.key
# or paste its hex here instead, e.g. LIGHTFERRY_KEY=<64 hex chars, generated by keygen; this is no example key>
